    "name": {
      "zh": "TRS-80 Model I",
      "en": "TRS-80 Model I"
    },
    "intro": {
      "zh": "TRS-80 Model I 是 1977 年 Tandy/RadioShack 推出的 8 位家用电脑，与 Apple II、Commodore PET 并称 1977 三杰，借零售网络成为个人电脑元年的畅销机型。",
      "en": "The TRS-80 Model I, launched by Tandy/RadioShack in 1977, was one of the 1977 Trinity of personal computers alongside the Apple II and Commodore PET."
    },
    "spec_version": "0.2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine_min_version": "0.1.0",
    "precision_level": "L2",
    "era": 1977,
    "manufacturer": "Tandy / RadioShack",
    "category": "personal-computer",
    "description": "TRS-80 Model I（1977），1977 三杰之一：Z80 CPU 1.774MHz、4KB 内存、64×16 单色显示、53 键键盘主机一体、卡式磁带存储、底部 DIN 扩展口。",
